Package: tokenusagedata
Title: AI Token Prices, Context Windows and Model Sizes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Jack", family = "He",
           email = "jack.beanstalk.2022@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Pistachio Technology Inc.", role = "cph"))
Description: Provides five documented data frames for analysing artificial
    intelligence (AI) model application programming interface (API) prices,
    published context windows, and published or estimated parameter counts.
    Fixed October 2026 snapshots retain source URLs and qualifications and
    add typed dates and numeric quantities for reproducible comparisons and
    teaching. Data are from Pistachio Technology Inc. (2026), published at
    <https://tokenusage.dev/publications>:
    API prices <doi:10.5281/zenodo.23552904>,
    context windows <doi:10.5281/zenodo.23552975>, and
    model sizes <doi:10.5281/zenodo.23553072>.
    These are selected historical records; estimated sizes are distinguished
    from lab disclosures.
